{"nodes": [{"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design", "label": "Design - Aplicar mejoras de Tarea_7 al Integration Service BKT", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_integration_service_stack", "label": "Integration Service BKT stack: Express 5, TypeScript strict, MongoDB/Mongoose 8", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_d1_empty_env_var_default_preprocess", "label": "D1: Empty env var applies default via z.preprocess(blankToUndefined, z.stringbool().default(...))", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default INSIDE the preprocess; z.stringbool() preserves strict parsing of the .env.test values ('false' stays false), whereas z.coerce.boolean() would flip them because Boolean('false') is true."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_d2_dispatched_execution_id_traceability", "label": "D2: Traceability of dispatched execution_id (Punto 6)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The await is deliberate so a traceability failure is visible in the response while orchestrator notification stays fire-and-forget; it sits inside if (orchestratorDispatched) so [] is not written on runs that notified nothing; the field is optional so existing records are unaffected."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_d3_unique_index_with_duplicate_precheck", "label": "D3: Unique index meshId+itsmTicketId with duplicate pre-check (Punto 2)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "createIndex unique would fail with E11000 and break startup if duplicates exist, so an aggregation pre-check logs a warning and skips the index instead of cleaning data."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_d4_log_database_name_after_connect", "label": "D4: Log active DB name right after mongoose.connect (Punto 5)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mongoose emits the connected event inside connect, before listeners are registered, so a log in that listener never fires at startup."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_d5_real_date_persistence_tests", "label": "D5: Tests assert instanceof Date reading without .lean() (Punto 3)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "lean() returns POJOs where dates stop being Date instances; content is Schema.Types.Mixed so dates there are strings and are not asserted."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_d6_plain_error_middleware_test", "label": "D6: Plain Error test in the error middleware (Punto 1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A plain Error (not HttpError) returns 500 with err.message and no stack; with IS_LOCAL=true the real message is exposed; the stack stays in logs only."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_d7_environment_test_require_pattern", "label": "D7: environment.test.ts with require() + jest.resetModules()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dynamic import() fails in Jest CJS without --experimental-vm-modules, so minimal env vars are set before require()."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_rejected_z_coerce_boolean", "label": "Rejected alternative: z.coerce.boolean()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Silent regression: Boolean('false') is true, flipping LOG_PRETTY_PRINT and CORS_CREDENTIALS to true; CORS_CREDENTIALS=true with CORS_ORIGIN='*' is rejected by browsers."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_rejected_default_outside_preprocess", "label": "Rejected alternative: default outside the preprocess", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verified empirically to fail: an empty string becomes undefined and z.stringbool() throws before the outer default applies."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_rejected_auto_cleanup_of_duplicates", "label": "Rejected alternative: automatically cleaning duplicates", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Destructive and out of scope; no data is touched."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_05_aplicar_mejoras_tarea_7_integration_service_design_environment_ts", "label": "src/config/environment.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-05-aplicar-mejoras-tarea-7-integration-service/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": 